  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "气体没有固定的形状，它总是具有它所在的空间或容器：",
        "房间、气罐、玻璃瓶等的形状."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "总之，各种气体都具有下述的一些共同性质：**气体没有",
        "一定的体积和固有的形状——要占满可能提供给它的全部体",
        "积，其可被压缩的程度是液体的几千倍.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "问题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "举出一种物质，它的三种状态：固态、液态和气态，我",
        "们都可以经常见到."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "指出固体的共同性质."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "3",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "你知道哪些种液体？列举出液体的共同性质."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "4",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "气体有哪些共同性质？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "练习4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "一个物体体积保持不变，但形状很容易发生变化. 试问组成这",
        "个物体的物质处于哪一种状态？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "一个物体保持体积和形状不变. 试问组成这个物体的物质处",
        "于哪一种状态？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "3",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "试举出几个在工程技术中应用固体及液体性质的例子来."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "14. 固体、液体和气体分子结构的差别"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "冰、水和水蒸汽不过是同一种物质——水的三种状态. 这",
        "就是说，冰、水和水蒸汽的分子彼此没有区别."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因此，三态的区别不在于分子本身，而是在于分子是怎",
        "样分布和运动的. 那么，气体、液体和固体的分子究竟是怎",
        "样分布，怎样运动的呢？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "28"
      ]
    }
  ]
